msgid "Show a warning to the user, allowing approval only after additional confirmation"
msgstr "Rodyti naudotojui įspėjimą ir leisti pritarti tik po papildomo patvirtinimo"

msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: SolutionApprovalGuard 1.0\n"
"Language: lt_LT\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n > 1);\n"

msgid "Allowed (GLPI default behavior)"
msgstr "Leidžiama (numatytasis GLPI elgesys)"

msgid "Block solution approval when there is a comment"
msgstr "Blokuoti sprendimo patvirtinimą, kai yra komentaras"

msgid "Comments during solution approval"
msgstr "Komentarai sprendimo patvirtinimo metu"

msgid "Configuration saved successfully."
msgstr "Konfigūracija sėkmingai išsaugota."

msgid "Error saving configuration."
msgstr "Klaida išsaugant konfigūraciją."

msgid ""
"It is not allowed to enter comments when approving a solution. Please leave "
"the text box empty or refuse the solution."
msgstr ""
"Patvirtinant sprendimą neleidžiama įvesti komentarų. Prašome palikti teksto "
"laukelį tuščią arba atmesti sprendimą."

msgid "Show warning to the user, allowing the solution approval"
msgstr "Rodyti įspėjimą vartotojui, leidžiant patvirtinti"

msgid "Solution Approval Guard"
msgstr "Sprendimų Patvirtinimo Sergėtojas"

msgid "Solution Approval Settings"
msgstr "Sprendimų Patvirtinimo Nustatymai"

msgid "Solution approved"
msgstr "Sprendimas patvirtintas"

msgid ""
"Warning: Your solution was approved, but to report pending issues you must "
"refuse the solution or open a new ticket."
msgstr ""
"Įspėjimas: Jūsų sprendimas buvo patvirtintas, bet norėdami pranešti apie "
"laukiančias problemas, turite atmesti sprendimą arba atidaryti naują "
"bilietą."

msgid "Approval with a comment is allowed immediately. A warning is displayed after submission to explain that pending issues should be reported by refusing the solution or opening a new ticket. No additional confirmation is requested and approval is not blocked."
msgstr "Patvirtinimas su komentaru leidžiamas nedelsiant. A warning is displayed after submission to explain that pending issues should be reported by refusing the solution or opening a new ticket. No additional confirmation is requested and approval is not blocked."

msgid "Approval is blocked on the server when the comment contains text. To approve, the user must clear the comment; if the problem persists, they should refuse the solution instead. Empty HTML tags and spaces alone are not considered a comment."
msgstr "Patvirtinimas serveryje blokuojamas, kai komentare yra tekstas. Kad patvirtintų, vartotojas turi išvalyti komentarą; jei problema išlieka, jie turėtų atsisakyti sprendimo. Vien tik tuščios HTML žymos ir tarpai nelaikomi komentaru."

msgid "When the user approves a solution with a comment, a confirmation dialog is displayed before submission. Approve anyway continues the approval with the comment. Cancel, Escape or closing the dialog keeps the comment without submitting the approval. If the problem persists, the user should cancel and refuse the solution instead. Empty comments do not require additional confirmation."
msgstr "Kai vartotojas patvirtina sprendimą su komentaru, prieš jį pateikiant rodomas patvirtinimo dialogo langas. Patvirtinti vis tiek tęsia patvirtinimą su komentaru. Atšaukti, pabėgti arba uždarius dialogo langą, komentaras išsaugomas nepateikus patvirtinimo. Jei problema išlieka, vartotojas turėtų atšaukti ir atsisakyti sprendimo. Tušti komentarai nereikalauja papildomo patvirtinimo."
